<title>USA: Silicon Gaming gets approval in Nevada.</title>
<headline>Silicon Gaming gets approval in Nevada.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, Calif. 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Silicon Gaming Inc said the Nevada Gaming Commission gave it regulatory approval to initiate sales of its Odyssey slot machines in Nevada.</p>
<p>Machines would be available in various Station Casinos Properties in Las Vegas starting later this month, it said.</p>
<p>Silicon Gaming designs and makes interactive slot machines for use in casinos and other gaming establishments.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
